5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is lovely that our team is growing. I hope we can find a layout that helps us all stay connected and chat more often.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"Growth is good, but we should be careful. Some spots in this room are objectively worse than others. We need to be fair about that.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I agree. I just... I wonder if we have enough budget for a big change. I'm a bit worried about the costs.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,I'm so excited for a fresh start! But we have to make sure the new setup doesn't make our mornings a mess. I hate wasting time!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's not get carried away by ""vibes."" If we're doing this, let's look at the actual data regarding the environment and the costs.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Daisuke, please don't worry too much. I'm sure we can find a way. Perhaps we should look into the billing and the power costs?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I want to know how seats were handled in the past. If there's a pattern of some people always getting the bad spots, we should fix it.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shizue, thank you... Yes, I think knowing the billing basis would be... helpful. I don't want us to overspend.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi, what data do you mean? I want to know how people actually start their day. If it's a hassle, it's a bad plan!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mio, I'm talking about the physical reality of sitting in a chair for eight hours. Noise levels and ergonomics aren't just ""vibes.""","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I also wonder if we can learn from the new joiners. They might have a fresh perspective on who they feel comfortable talking to.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"I'm interested in the staff survey. I want to see if the ""drawn plan"" actually matches what people want, or if it's just a guess.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I guess I should also check the quote for the power and network. If it's too expensive, we might have to be careful.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mio,,"I'm going to check out the pilot floor upstairs! If they have a smooth morning routine, we should totally copy it!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll handle the technical side of comfort. I'll look into the sound readings and the physio's notes. Someone has to prioritize the body.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,That sounds like a wonderful plan. Let's see what we find and decide together with kindness.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,Agreed. Let's just make sure we don't ignore the uncomfortable truths about the seating.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,Okay... I'll do my best to find the information.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Mio,,Yay! I can't wait to see what's happening upstairs! This is going to be great!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Try not to get too excited, Mio. Data is usually far less glamorous than you imagine.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
