34,2,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"I found that we are paying for space, not people. Also, our new friends learned so much just by listening to us talk!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The survey shows people hate the interior wall desks, yet the current plan still leaves three people stuck there. It's a recipe for resentment.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... the power quote is 6,200 yen per desk. And we're paying for empty space every month. I think... we should be very careful.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Guys, listen! The pilot floor takes up to nine minutes just to set up! If we do a ""free seat"" thing, we'll waste so much time every morning!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"As expected. The noise by the door is a nightmare, and the physio confirms that a comfortable setup takes days of tweaking.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, that does sound like a bit of a bother. But @Daisuke, if we are paying for empty space, maybe we can use it to spread out?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"Spreading out doesn't solve the fairness issue. If we have ""good"" and ""bad"" seats, we need a system to rotate them.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'm not sure. If we move everyone, the power costs will add up quickly. 6,200 yen per person... it's a lot for our budget.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mio,,"Exactly! And the badge records show we don't even arrive at the same time. A ""first-come"" system is just a ""who wakes up earliest"" system!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Rotating seats is a disaster. If it takes days to get a workstation physically right, moving every month is just a way to ensure chronic back pain.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I feel for everyone. I just want us to be able to help each other. The new joiners really benefited from being near us.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, I understand the physical cost, but the mental cost of being the ""unlucky one"" in the dark corner is higher.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think we should avoid any plan that requires frequent changes. The cost of re-running cables every time would be... overwhelming.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mio,,I'm with Daisuke! Let's not do anything that adds friction to our day. I can't handle spending ten minutes just to start working!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"For once, I agree with Mio. Stability is the only rational choice. We need fixed seats that are optimized for the individual.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"It seems we are torn between fairness, comfort, and connection. Let's look at the options and find a gentle middle ground.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"I will support any option that explicitly addresses who gets the interior seats, rather than leaving it to chance or habit.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I just... I hope we pick the one that is most stable. I don't want to worry about the budget every month.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Mio,,"As long as I don't have to spend my morning fighting with a power cable, I'm happy!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's just ensure that ""comfort"" is actually a criterion and not just a footnote in the final decision.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
