60,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Option B seems the most peaceful. It gives us stability, and we can group people so they can talk and help each other.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Option B is the most dangerous. It creates a permanent hierarchy of ""good"" and ""bad"" seats that will never be addressed.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think Option B is the safest for the budget. No constant re-running of cables, and no wasted time.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Mio,,Option A is a total nightmare! Nine minutes of setup every single day? No way! I vote against A with everything I have!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Option A and C are absurd. A is a waste of time, and C is a physical torture chamber. B is the only logical choice for ergonomics.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Toshio, if we choose B, perhaps we can decide together who sits where, rather than letting the furniture decide for us?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"That is exactly the point. If we go with B, we must explicitly agree on who takes the interior wall seats. We cannot ignore it.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"If we can just... agree on the seats once, then we won't have to spend more money on facilities. I think B is best.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, if you can make the seat-picking fair, then B is perfect! It's fast, it's easy, and I can just sit down and start!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Exactly. Once a seat is tuned to the user's height and the noise is managed, you leave it alone. B is the only option that respects the body.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"I am so glad we are finding a way to agree. If we group ourselves thoughtfully, we can keep that wonderful spirit of sharing.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,"I can accept B, provided the ""unlucky"" seats are assigned through a transparent process, not just by who is the most senior or the quietest.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I feel much better now. If we all agree on B, the budget will be stable, and I won't have to worry about it.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Mio,,"Yes! No more ""morning setup stress""! I'm all for B! Let's just make sure we have a little space for snacks!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,Let's not get distracted by snacks. The point is stability. B is the only choice that doesn't treat our physical comfort as an afterthought.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Shizue,,It seems we have found a path that respects everyone's needs. I am very happy we could talk this through so kindly.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Toshio,,"As long as the distribution of the ""bad"" seats is handled openly, I am satisfied. I vote for B.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. I vote for B. It's the most stable and cost-effective way.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Mio,,"B all the way! Fast mornings, happy Mio! I vote for B!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Finally, some rationality. I vote for B. Let's get this over with so I can go back to my quiet corner.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
